<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Game of Life in Opal - Saltvedt.net</title>
    <script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-1.11.0.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-migrate-1.2.1.min.js"></script>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://maxcdn.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/3.3.5/css/bootstrap.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Raleway:300">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://saltvedt.net/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="./style.css">
  </head>
  <body class="portfolio reading-page">
    <main class="site-shell reading-shell">
      <header class="article-header">
        <h1>Game of Life in Opal</h1>
      </header>
      <div class="article-prose">
        <p>
          This is an implementation of Game of Life in Opal (a Ruby to Javascript transpiler), loosely based on <a href="https://www.sitepoint.com/opal-ruby-browser-game-life/">this Sitepoint tutorial.</a>

          The source code is <a href="https://github.com/saltvedt/game-of-life-opal">available on Github</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          <button id="start_stop" class="btn btn-default" type="button">Start</button>
          <button id="step" class="btn btn-default" type="button">Step</button>
          <button id="clear" class="btn btn-default" type="button">Clear</button>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div id="gridContainer">
        <canvas id="gameCanvas" height="800"></canvas>
      </div>
    </main>
    <%= javascript_include_tag 'game-of-life' %>
  </body>
</html>
